/** @mainpage Qore amqp Module

    @tableofcontents

    @section amqpintro amqp Module Introduction

    The \c amqp module provides an AMQP 1.0 messaging interface for %Qore using the
    <a href="https://qpid.apache.org/proton/">Apache Qpid Proton</a> C++ library.

    This module provides:
    - The @ref Qore::Amqp::AmqpConnection "AmqpConnection" class for connecting to AMQP 1.0 brokers
    - The @ref Qore::Amqp::AmqpMessage "AmqpMessage" class for creating and reading AMQP messages
    - Full bidirectional type mapping between AMQP and %Qore types
    - TLS/SSL and SASL authentication support
    - Durable subscriptions and message selectors
    - Transaction support (commit/rollback)
    - Broker introspection via the AMQP Management Protocol
    - The @ref amqputilintro "AmqpUtil" module with high-level client, producer, consumer, and request-reply helpers
    - The @ref amqpdataproviderintro "AmqpDataProvider" module for data provider framework integration

